      "created_at": "2024-07-22T05:18:23.852Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/letienit\">@LeTienIT</a> write a client script applied to list :</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.listview_settings['Sales Invoice'] = {\n    onload: function(listview) {\n        frappe.after_ajax(() =&gt; {\n             $('.filter-selector').hide();\n        });\n    }\n};\n</code></pre>",
